# "If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard" (CR 303.7): two Genealogists put a Royal Role on Memnite one after the other. The first Role is put into
# the graveyard (a token that ceases to exist) so only one Role stays on the Memnite, which is 2/2 (+1/+1 once), not 3/3. With Memnite the only other creature the first trigger
# has a single legal target and picks it; the second has two (Memnite, the first Genealogist).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Memnite
Redtooth Genealogist
Redtooth Genealogist
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Redtooth Genealogist#1.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Redtooth Genealogist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Royal.AttachedTo = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
